@startuml
title Owner Page — Обзор (KPI, активность, тепловая карта)

actor Owner
participant "OwnerPage" as Page
participant "AdminController" as AC
participant "User" as User
participant "Challenge" as Challenge
participant "HistoryChallenge" as HC
participant "ReportModel" as RC

Owner -> Page: click "Overview"

Page -> AC: dispatch(getOverview())
AC -> User: getOverview()
User --> AC: userStats
AC -> Challenge: getOverview()
Challenge --> AC: challengeStats
AC -> HC: getOverview()
HC --> AC: historyStats
AC -> RC: getOverview()
RC --> AC: reportStats
AC --> Page: overview

Page -> AC: dispatch(getActivity(from, to))
AC -> HC: getActivity(from, to)
HC --> AC: activity[]
AC --> Page: activity[]

Page -> AC: dispatch(getActivityHeatmap())
AC -> HC: getActivityHeatmap()
HC --> AC: heatmap[]
AC --> Page: heatmap[]

Page --> Owner: рендер Overview (KPI, график активности, тепловая карта)

Owner -> Page: select период → setPeriodIdx(n)
Page -> AC: dispatch(getActivity(from, to))
AC -> HC: getActivity(from, to)
HC --> AC: activity[]
AC --> Page: activity[]
Page --> Owner: обновлённый график активности

Owner -> Page: input[type=date] → setCustomFrom / setCustomTo
Page -> AC: dispatch(getActivity(customFrom, customTo))
AC -> HC: getActivity(customFrom, customTo)
HC --> AC: activity[]
AC --> Page: activity[]
Page --> Owner: обновлённый график по кастомному периоду

@enduml
